wordcraft-docx               L2             doc, geom, doc (dev)
wordcraft-engine             L4             doc, docbin, docx, fonts, formats, geom, layout, pdf, render
wordcraft-fonts              L1             
wordcraft-formats            L2             doc, geom, metafile, doc (dev)
wordcraft-geom               L0             
wordcraft-layout             L2             doc, fonts, geom, metafile
wordcraft-mcp                L5             control-key, doc, engine, render
wordcraft-metafile           L1             
wordcraft-pdf                L3             doc, fonts, geom, layout, metafile
wordcraft-render             L3             doc, fonts, geom, layout, metafile
wordcraft-ui-egui            L6             doc, engine, fonts, geom, layout, render, zotero, engine (dev)
wordcraft-web                exempt         doc, engine, fonts, ui-egui
wordcraft-zotero             L5             doc, engine, formats, docx (dev)
xtask                        exempt         

OK: 19 crates, no layering violations.
